2. Integration Testing Scenario – Zomato Payment Flow

1. Verify that the selected food items are successfully transferred from the cart to the order placement module.
2. Verify that the order details are correctly sent to the payment gateway.
3. Verify that the payment gateway accepts valid payment details.
4. Verify that the payment is processed successfully for a valid transaction.
5. Verify that the order is confirmed only after successful payment.
6. Verify that the payment status is updated correctly in the order module.
7. Verify that a payment failure displays an appropriate error message and the order is not confirmed.
8. Verify that the user receives an order confirmation message after successful payment.
9. Verify that the payment transaction ID is stored correctly in the system.
10. Verify that the order history is updated after the payment is completed successfully.
